{"seq":26,"slug":"markov-chain-monte-carlo","title":"马尔可夫链蒙特卡洛","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"马尔可夫链蒙特卡洛\">马尔可夫链蒙特卡洛</h1><p>贝叶斯推断里几乎所有有意思的后验分布都写不出闭式解：归一化常数是一个高维积分，维度一高，网格求积和拒绝采样全部失效。马尔可夫链蒙特卡洛（MCMC）绕开了这道墙——它不去计算积分，而是构造一条以目标分布为平稳分布的马氏链，让链跑起来，用链上的样本去逼近期望。只要链遍历且收敛，样本均值就能任意逼近真值。这一思路从 1953 年的 Metropolis 算法发端，到今天成了 Stan、PyMC、NumPyro 等概率编程工具的推断引擎。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 把 MCMC 拆成四条递进主线。<strong>基础</strong>先讲清楚两块地基：一是蒙特卡洛积分本身——为什么随机采样能算积分、误差为何按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衰减而与维度无关；二是马氏链的平稳分布与遍历性，以及让「采样收敛到目标分布」成立的细致平衡条件。<strong>采样器</strong>进入算法主体：Metropolis-Hastings 是统一框架，Gibbs 采样是它在可整条件分布下的特例，而提议分布的设计直接决定一条链好不好用。<strong>现代方法</strong>讲哈密顿蒙特卡洛如何借物理动力学在高维里走得又远又准，NUTS 如何把 HMC 的两个棘手参数自动调好，以及 MCMC 与变分推断在「准确 vs 快」上的取舍。<strong>实践</strong>收口到工程：怎样用 R-hat 和有效样本量判断收敛、怎样诊断和改善混合、怎样在概率编程语言里把这一切落地。</p>\n<p>与兄弟 hub 的分工要划清楚。<a href=\"../stochastic-processes/\">随机过程</a> 讲马氏链作为随机过程本身的理论——转移矩阵、常返与暂留、连续时间链；本 hub 只取其中「平稳分布存在且唯一」这一结论作为工具，把重心放在「如何反过来构造一条链去命中给定的目标分布」。<a href=\"../probability-statistics/\">概率统计</a> 里的贝叶斯统计章节讲清楚先验、后验、贝叶斯框架这些「要算什么」的问题；本 hub 接手「算不出来时怎么数值逼近」。<a href=\"../optimization-theory/\">最优化理论</a> 与本 hub 是对偶关系：变分推断把推断问题转成优化问题，HMC 的 leapfrog 又和梯度下降共享微分几何直觉，但优化求的是点估计，MCMC 求的是整个分布——这条边界在「MCMC 与变分推断」一篇里专门厘清。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>。如果你是想做贝叶斯建模的工程师，按 基础→采样器→实践→现代方法 走，先把 MH/Gibbs 跑通、会看收敛诊断，再回头理解 HMC 为什么更快。如果你是数理背景、想吃透原理，按本 hub 的自然顺序 基础→采样器→现代方法→实践 线性推进，每一篇的数学都自洽承接上一篇。如果你只是想在 PyMC/Stan 里调通一个模型、看不动报错，可以直接跳到 实践 章的三篇，再按需回溯前置概念。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：需要 <a href=\"../probability-statistics/probability-foundations/bayes-theorem\">条件概率与贝叶斯定理</a>、<a href=\"../probability-statistics/random-variables/expectation-variance\">期望与方差</a> 的基本功；理解 HMC 那两篇还需要多元微积分里的梯度概念。马氏链的最小知识本 hub 会自带补齐，但若想要完整理论，建议先读 <a href=\"../stochastic-processes/markov/markov-chains\">随机过程</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monte-carlo-integration","title":"蒙特卡洛积分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/monte-carlo-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"markov-chain-stationarity","title":"马氏链与平稳分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/markov-chain-stationarity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"detailed-balance","title":"细致平衡与可逆性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/detailed-balance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"samplers","title":"采样器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/samplers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"metropolis-hastings","title":"Metropolis-Hastings 采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/samplers/metropolis-hastings"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gibbs-sampling","title":"Gibbs 采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/samplers/gibbs-sampling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"proposal-design","title":"提议分布设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/samplers/proposal-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern","title":"现代方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hamiltonian-monte-carlo","title":"哈密顿蒙特卡洛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern/hamiltonian-monte-carlo"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nuts-sampler","title":"NUTS 与自适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern/nuts-sampler"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mcmc-vs-variational","title":"MCMC 与变分推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern/mcmc-vs-variational"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"convergence-diagnostics","title":"收敛诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice/convergence-diagnostics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mixing-tuning","title":"混合与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice/mixing-tuning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mcmc-ppl","title":"概率编程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice/mcmc-ppl"}]}]}